# 📊 Customer Churn Prediction Project

## 📌 Project Overview

This project aims to analyze customer data and predict customer churn using machine learning techniques. The goal is to identify patterns that help businesses retain customers.

## 🛠 Technologies Used

* Python (Pandas, NumPy)
* Data Visualization (Matplotlib, Seaborn)
* Machine Learning (Scikit-learn, XGBoost)
* SQL
* Jupyter Notebook

## 📊 Project Workflow

1. Data Collection and Preparation
2. Data Cleaning & Preprocessing
3. Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
4. Feature Engineering
5. Model Training (Classification Models)
6. Model Evaluation

## 📈 Key Insights

* Identified key factors influencing customer churn
* Built predictive model to classify customers at risk
* Provided data-driven recommendations for retention strategies

## 🚀 Conclusion

The model helps businesses proactively identify customers likely to churn and take action to improve retention.

